Today’s Episode: Amazon Route 53 🌍 — The GPS of the Internet!

Imagine the internet is a massive city and users are trying to visit your website 🏙️
They know the name of the place (domain) but not the exact location (IP address).

Who guides them safely?
Who makes sure they don’t get lost or stuck in traffic? 🚦

Enter Amazon Route 53 — your smart cloud navigator 🧭.

Here’s how the drama unfolds 🎬
	•	🧠 User types your domain: www.vaishnew.com
Route 53 instantly finds the correct destination (IP address).
	•	🚦 It directs traffic intelligently using:
	•	Latency-based routing
	•	Weighted routing
	•	Geo routing
	•	Failover routing
	•	🚑 If your main server goes down, Route 53 redirects users to a healthy backup.
	•	🛡️ It performs health checks and keeps your app highly available.
	•	⚡ It acts like a traffic police + GPS + emergency dispatcher combined.

And the best part?
Your users never even realise the drama happening behind the scenes 😎

⸻

